---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | Ontario Mobile Line Boring" description="Website terms for Ontario Mobile Line Boring, including preliminary estimate limitations and service conditions.">
  <Header />
  <main class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl prose prose-lg text-gray-700">
      <h1 class="text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      <p><strong>Draft notice:</strong> These terms are a template and require review by the operating business and qualified legal counsel before launch.</p>

      <h2>Website Information</h2>
      <p>Content on this website is provided for general informational purposes. Service availability, coverage, timing, capabilities, and pricing must be confirmed directly before work is scheduled.</p>

      <h2>Preliminary Estimates</h2>
      <p>Calculator results are preliminary estimates only. They are not offers, contracts, or binding quotes. Final scope and pricing depend on equipment condition, measurements, access, travel, materials, and technician inspection.</p>

      <h2>Emergency and Response-Time Claims</h2>
      <p>Displayed response times are estimates and are not guarantees. Actual timing depends on technician availability, location, traffic, weather, site-access requirements, and the nature of the repair.</p>

      <h2>Service Authorization</h2>
      <p>No service relationship begins until the operating provider confirms the work, pricing, scheduling, safety requirements, and customer authorization.</p>

      <h2>Limitation</h2>
      <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, the website owner is not liable for decisions made solely from preliminary calculator results or general website content.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><!-- TODO: Insert verified business contact information before launch. -->Contact details will be published after the operating provider verifies them.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
